\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Out-of-region transfer gap ($\Delta $ macro-F1) grouped by inductive-bias family. Sparse/tree-like and linear models transfer (small $|\Delta |$); dense temporal/patch nets, synthetic augmentation, and a linear classifier on 10{,}000 random features (MiniRocket) overfit the training region. L-TAE-S, which adds sparse feature selection to a dense attention backbone, tracks the tree-based models. Bars are family means; points are individual models.}}{18}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:bias}{{5}{18}{Out-of-region transfer gap ($\Delta $ macro-F1) grouped by inductive-bias family. Sparse/tree-like and linear models transfer (small $|\Delta |$); dense temporal/patch nets, synthetic augmentation, and a linear classifier on 10{,}000 random features (MiniRocket) overfit the training region. L-TAE-S, which adds sparse feature selection to a dense attention backbone, tracks the tree-based models. Bars are family means; points are individual models}{figure.5}{}}
